The key to piloting Lightning, Army of One is understanding its core engine: Lightning has first strike, trample, and lifelink. Her Stagger ability doubles all damage that player takes until your next turn. Combining her with extra combat steps and equipment turns each hit into lethal exponential damage.
This is a Bracket 3 build running three Game Changers: Smothering Tithe, Teferi's Protection, Jeska's Will. It contains zero mass land denial and focuses on high-synergy board development, interactive answers, and an inevitable endgame clock.

# Commander and Core Synergy
Lightning, Army of One :: primary commander driving the deck's core strategy
Aurelia, the Warleader :: critical engine card maximizing commander synergy and card advantage
Combat Celebrant :: critical engine card maximizing commander synergy and card advantage
Karlach, Fury of Avernus :: critical engine card maximizing commander synergy and card advantage
Embercleave :: critical engine card maximizing commander synergy and card advantage
Colossus Hammer :: critical engine card maximizing commander synergy and card advantage

